  "body": "Positioned in a highly desirable coastal neighborhood, this brand-new single-level home offers a refined blend of quality construction, generous space, and flexible living options.\r\n\r\nConstructed to a high specification, the residence features high-ceiling architecture—highlighted by a grand raked ceiling in the main domain—and modern double-glazed window joinery for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nThe highly intuitive floor plan is cleverly divided to offer versatile dual-zone functionality. Directly accessible off the main entry foyer, a private front wing features two bedrooms, a dedicated lounge, and a full bathroom. This self-contained setup provides an ideal space for extended family, guest accommodation, or quiet work-from-home flexibility with complete independence from the main household.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the expansive open-plan main living and dining domain serves as an impressive central hub, enhanced by elevated raked ceilings that fill the space with natural light. The sleek main kitchen is beautifully appointed and includes an adjoining walk-in scullery for discreet meal preparation and extra storage.\r\n\r\nThe rear quarters house three additional spacious bedrooms, including a private master suite complete with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while the remaining two bedrooms share a dedicated full bathroom. There is also a separate guest WC, and a dedicated laundry room.\r\n\r\nGlass sliding doors open from the main living area onto a private, fully fenced garden retreat. Practicality is rounded out by a double internal garage. Offering layout flexibility, high-spec single-level home, private outdoor living, and convenient access to Long Bay Beach, regional park trails, vibrant local village shops, and nearby public transport connections, this property is an ideal solution for multi-generational families or astute buyers.\r\n\r\nThe vendor's instructions are clear, and this property must be sold. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.",
